      "instance_name": "racial_profiling_concept",
      "label": "Concept: Racial Profiling",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the real-world practice of racial profiling, where law enforcement targets individuals based on their race or ethnicity rather than concrete evidence of wrongdoing. This concept is critical to understanding the meme's message and its connection to systemic racism.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
